assing over."}, {"turn": 44, "text": "Opus 5.5's H1 lost 12.3, taking the lead from +8.2 to +20.5. The engine's choice was H3. Opus 5.5 played H3 itself two turns later and lost nothing, but Black's A7 had already given back 11.3, leaving the lead at +9.2, and it stayed near +8 to the end."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "libs.py and count.py only parse a pasted board and report group liberties and an area count of the current position (flood fill, no move generation or lookahead); the other commands just cat files and append to games.md, so nothing chose or ranked moves.", "stop": false}}